{"unit_id":"mumuer1024__dsh-ui-liteglass#feature-1","repo":"mumuer1024/dsh-ui-liteglass","commit":"4e5d2f0d378a139bb2a8b47f5636592c885ecf37","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"LiteGlass 的「自定义壁纸」功能：在通用设置中选择远程图片 URL 或本地上传，并调节背景透明度与模糊程度；本地图片会保存到 DSH 主机供客户端显示。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:549-580","lib/index.js:349-383"]}
